        "created_at": "2022-05-06T13:09:01.388Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s a one-off, but like The Matriarch, there was a “modern” retelling. In Cosmitron’s case that was in early <em>Cosmic Concurrence</em> in like 2008 or so. That’s where we’re told that the element of there being an <em>intentionality</em> behind the cosmic power-up rather than it just being this weird thing that happened. Of course, a DE-era retcon to how that all went down is also possible.</p>",
